WEBVTT

00:01.860 --> 00:03.150
Yuji.

00:03.520 --> 00:04.460
Hmm?

00:06.100 --> 00:08.860
You're a strong kid, so help others.

00:18.290 --> 00:21.550
Episode 41
Thunderclap, Part 2

00:21.550 --> 00:26.560
23:05      Dogenzaka, In Front of Shibuya 109

00:24.610 --> 00:27.720
In my Ten Shadows Technique,

00:28.180 --> 00:31.820
only two Demon Dogs are 
granted to the user at first.

00:32.440 --> 00:37.530
The other shikigami aren't granted to the 
user until they finish subjugating them.

00:38.840 --> 00:44.750
The user must continue subjugating each one 
to increase the shikigami available to them,

00:44.750 --> 00:49.400
until they are finally able to 
command all ten shikigami.

00:53.460 --> 00:54.620
You done?

00:55.610 --> 00:59.820
You're really strong, 
just like that woman from earlier.

00:59.820 --> 01:01.130
Even though you're young.

01:01.960 --> 01:05.230
You're all beat up, yet you give 
me no openings to get close.

01:05.640 --> 01:09.730
Though, with all that bleeding, 
I won't even have to do anything.

01:13.650 --> 01:18.870
Thing is, this subjugation can 
be done with multiple people.

01:19.080 --> 01:25.150
Though conducting the subjugation 
with multiple people voids it afterward.

01:25.150 --> 01:30.990
Which means the ritual becomes 
pointless to the sorcerer themselves.

01:31.900 --> 01:37.000
Still, even if it is pointless, 
there are ways to use it.

01:40.640 --> 01:42.020
Who's that?

01:42.020 --> 01:43.280
They're being real flashy.

01:44.400 --> 01:46.120
To continue,

01:48.000 --> 01:52.870
while the shikigami can't be used 
without first subjugating it,

01:53.530 --> 01:56.220
the user can summon them 
as many times as necessary

01:56.220 --> 01:58.280
for the purpose of subjugating them.

01:58.780 --> 01:59.760
You don't mean...

02:02.630 --> 02:04.880
In all of sorcerer history, there's never been

02:04.880 --> 02:08.390
anyone who managed 
to subjugate this one.

02:09.440 --> 02:13.500
Do you know why the Gojo clan 
and the Zen'in clan are on bad terms?

02:14.080 --> 02:16.560
Are they actually on bad 
terms in the first place?

02:16.560 --> 02:19.220
Sparks are constantly flying.

02:19.220 --> 02:22.250
Since the Edo era? Or the Keicho era?

02:22.490 --> 02:23.880
I forget when,

02:23.880 --> 02:29.140
but the heads of the clans at the time 
got serious during a spectated match,

02:29.140 --> 02:30.880
and they both died.

02:31.440 --> 02:33.380
Were the heads of those clans...

02:33.970 --> 02:39.150
One was someone like me who possessed both 
the Six-Eyes and the Limitless technique.

02:39.150 --> 02:43.140
And the other used the same 
technique as you, Megumi.

02:44.990 --> 02:46.950
The Ten Shadows Technique.

02:49.420 --> 02:52.600
Understand what I'm getting at?

02:53.240 --> 02:57.970
That doesn't mean I can actually become 
a sorcerer capable of beating you.

02:59.360 --> 03:03.740
I imagine the head of the clan used 
this in much the same way back then.

03:06.060 --> 03:09.390
Sacred treasure swing and ring, ring.

03:13.120 --> 03:14.720
Sukuna-sama?

03:14.720 --> 03:16.200
Urgent business.

03:16.660 --> 03:17.990
I see.

03:18.730 --> 03:23.160
It won't be much longer before I'm free.

03:23.790 --> 03:26.540
Do not slack on our preparations.

03:26.540 --> 03:28.320
See you later, Uraume.

03:28.320 --> 03:29.400
As you wish.

03:30.400 --> 03:32.570
I'll be awaiting your return.

03:50.160 --> 03:51.360
He tricked me!

03:52.620 --> 03:53.900
He's starting that ritual!

03:53.900 --> 03:58.180
And he's forcing me to participate 
in the damn thing with him!

03:58.810 --> 04:00.690
Eight-Grip Sword...

04:01.520 --> 04:03.160
Divergent Sila Divine General...

04:04.000 --> 04:05.160
Makora.

04:17.520 --> 04:18.490
See you later.

04:19.030 --> 04:19.950
Yeah!

04:20.840 --> 04:22.940
Sorry, Itadori.

04:23.680 --> 04:25.970
Hey, you damn bastard!

04:26.460 --> 04:28.310
I'll be dying first.

04:28.310 --> 04:30.160
Give it your best.

04:42.340 --> 04:43.360
Wait!

04:43.850 --> 04:46.220
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

04:46.220 --> 04:48.380
Oh, fuck you!

04:49.040 --> 04:50.380
Damn it!

04:50.600 --> 04:53.320
Wake up, you shitty sorcerer!

04:55.010 --> 04:58.060
The technique of the 
curse user Shigemo Haruta

04:58.060 --> 05:03.580
erases life's little daily miracles 
from his memory and stores them up.

05:03.920 --> 05:07.250
That stock manifests as the
markings under his eyes,

05:07.250 --> 05:10.850
and when he is faced with a threat 
to his life, one miracle is released.

05:16.100 --> 05:20.660
However, he is unaware of this fact himself.

05:21.060 --> 05:21.890
Huh?

05:28.770 --> 05:30.560
Suspended animation, huh?

05:32.040 --> 05:33.540
I see.

05:33.720 --> 05:37.490
So saving this piece of trash 
really was the right move.

05:38.140 --> 05:42.660
He probably sucked this thing into 
the subjugation ritual along with him.

05:43.140 --> 05:45.970
Once this trash dies, too, 
the ritual will be complete.

05:45.970 --> 05:49.080
Then Megumi Fushiguro's death 
will be established, as well.

05:50.220 --> 05:51.600
Don't die on me.

05:52.000 --> 05:55.570
There are things I need you to do for me.

05:56.740 --> 05:58.760
U-Um...

05:58.760 --> 05:59.960
Silence.

06:02.550 --> 06:05.040
For Megumi Fushiguro to survive,

06:05.040 --> 06:08.210
I'll have to defeat this 
shikigami as an outsider,

06:08.680 --> 06:11.980
and nullify his subjugation ritual.

06:16.280 --> 06:19.880
Time for a tasting, then.

06:25.190 --> 06:27.950
JUJUTSU KAISEN

06:25.190 --> 06:27.950
JUJUTSU KAISEN

06:53.010 --> 06:53.690
Dissect.

07:10.200 --> 07:12.160
That sword...

07:12.160 --> 07:15.290
It's the Sword of Exorcism, 
specialized in combating cursed spirits.

07:16.170 --> 07:20.080
It's packed with the same positive energy 
generated by a reverse cursed technique.

07:22.050 --> 07:23.800
If I was a cursed spirit,

07:23.800 --> 07:27.120
that would have eliminated 
me on the first blow.

07:29.280 --> 07:30.760
Tastes awful.

07:41.310 --> 07:42.200
You wanna go?!

09:05.420 --> 09:07.020
Oh?

09:07.340 --> 09:09.340
You did something, didn't you?

09:48.710 --> 09:50.040
What the hell?!

10:00.550 --> 10:02.600
Now that felt odd.

10:25.900 --> 10:27.200
Again?!

10:59.780 --> 11:00.440
What is that?!

11:00.440 --> 11:01.360
Run!

11:01.360 --> 11:02.600
Help us!

11:03.050 --> 11:04.180
We're falling!

11:22.390 --> 11:23.690
Cursed energy?!

11:26.120 --> 11:28.080
You've done it now!

12:01.960 --> 12:03.910
You can see it!

12:04.320 --> 12:06.570
You see my technique!

14:16.640 --> 14:18.100
I knew it.

14:18.100 --> 14:21.050
You're similar to Yamata no Orochi.

14:21.680 --> 14:23.920
You follow my slices,

14:23.920 --> 14:26.900
and attack with cursed energy...

14:26.900 --> 14:30.050
Both started happening after 
that great wheel revolved.

14:30.760 --> 14:32.990
The incantation of sacred treasures

14:32.990 --> 14:36.560
and that great wheel both represent 
perfect cycles and harmony.

14:36.560 --> 14:40.570
Which suggests that this shikigami's ability

14:40.570 --> 14:43.060
is to adapt to anything and everything.

14:43.060 --> 14:45.880
It's the ultimate late-throw 
rock-paper-scissors!

14:48.120 --> 14:52.840
You might have defeated me 
in the state I was in back then.

14:58.440 --> 15:01.720
Now you've fascinated me, Megumi Fushiguro!

15:04.320 --> 15:06.620
Domain Expansion:

15:08.070 --> 15:10.110
Malevolent Kitchen.

15:16.780 --> 15:20.790
Sukuna's Domain, Malevolent Kitchen,

15:21.640 --> 15:23.520
is unlike others in that

15:23.520 --> 15:26.560
it does not cut out a 
separate space with a barrier.

15:27.120 --> 15:31.160
Manifesting an innate domain 
without sealing it in a barrier

15:31.160 --> 15:35.500
is like trying to paint a picture 
in the air without a canvas.

15:36.270 --> 15:38.760
It's truly a divine feat.

15:39.920 --> 15:43.980
To top it off, by adding a pact to 
allow its victims a path of escape,

15:43.980 --> 15:46.550
it vastly increases the range of

15:46.560 --> 15:50.470
its guaranteed-hit effect to 
a maximum 200-meter radius.

15:51.760 --> 15:54.840
Though out of consideration for 
its effect on Megumi Fushiguro,

15:54.840 --> 16:00.430
he has currently restrained the effect to 
a 140-meter radius limited to the surface.

16:07.900 --> 16:08.990
Anything?

16:08.990 --> 16:10.630
Nope. No signal.

16:10.630 --> 16:11.530
Same.

16:12.000 --> 16:15.170
I don't think we need to 
worry that much, though.

16:15.170 --> 16:16.040
Huh?

16:16.570 --> 16:19.790
Remember the guy with the 
megaphone? He should be—

16:21.830 --> 16:24.700
Sukuna's slices are comprised of two types.

16:24.700 --> 16:29.820
"Fillet" attacks things with cursed energy 
in the range of his guaranteed-hit effect.

16:29.820 --> 16:32.550
"Dissect" attacks things 
without cursed energy.

16:33.320 --> 16:37.020
Both rain down endlessly upon everything 
until Malevolent Kitchen disappears.

16:38.920 --> 16:42.140
The only sure way to 
defeat Makora is to bury it

16:42.140 --> 16:46.130
with the first use of an 
attack before it can adapt.

16:47.020 --> 16:49.580
Fillet would have 
fulfilled those conditions,

16:49.580 --> 16:51.830
but that wouldn't necessarily hold true

16:51.830 --> 16:55.080
if it had adapted to slices in general,

16:55.490 --> 16:58.460
rather than to Dissect.

17:16.950 --> 17:21.020
Makora was close to 
finishing its regeneration.

17:49.380 --> 17:50.470
Fuga (Open).

18:42.710 --> 18:44.660
What are you looking at?

18:45.340 --> 18:46.570
Begone.

18:51.940 --> 18:55.700
E-Excuse me, then!

18:55.700 --> 18:58.360
I really am lucky!

18:58.860 --> 18:59.960
For another day...

18:59.960 --> 19:02.000
I survived!

19:04.080 --> 19:06.590
Shigemo's stock of miracles

19:06.590 --> 19:10.580
had been exhausted in his 
battle with Kento Nanami.

19:13.690 --> 19:16.220
Oh, it's nearly time.

19:19.630 --> 19:20.820
Fushiguro!

19:22.270 --> 19:24.840
I just saw Itadori for a moment...

19:26.040 --> 19:28.580
No, was it Sukuna?!

19:27.100 --> 19:31.480
23:14         Dogenzaka, In Front of Shibuya 109

19:35.350 --> 19:39.340
Hey, brat, be sure to savor this.

20:24.290 --> 20:26.050
Die!

20:26.860 --> 20:28.640
Only me!

20:29.260 --> 20:31.260
Only me!

20:32.130 --> 20:33.540
Die!

20:34.690 --> 20:36.400
Right now!

21:36.060 --> 21:37.430
I have to go.

21:39.310 --> 21:40.890
I have to fight.

21:49.900 --> 21:51.820
Otherwise, I'll just be...

21:53.250 --> 21:57.760
JUJUTSU KAISEN
Shibuya Incident

21:54.030 --> 21:55.910
a murderer.

23:52.690 --> 23:54.840
This has gotten really bad!

23:54.840 --> 23:57.000
I'll count prime numbers to calm down.

23:57.000 --> 24:00.280
One, two, three... uh, nine...

24:00.280 --> 24:01.690
You missed five and seven.

24:01.660 --> 24:02.810
Next time, "Right and Wrong."

24:01.790 --> 24:07.000
Next Episode
Right and Wrong

24:02.810 --> 24:04.650
You'll turn into a panda if you don't watch!

24:04.650 --> 24:06.420
You really are an animal...
